  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1505.02 Notice of Denial of License. The division shall give notice of a license denial directly to the applicant, notifying it of the rights of appeal in RSA 371:20.\n\nSource. #13939, eff 4-26-24\n\nAPPENDIX A\n\nAPPENDIX B\n\nDOCUMENTS INCORPORATED BY REFERENCE\n\nFEDERAL STANDARDS AND FORMS\n\nRule | Title | Publisher: How to Obtain; and Cost\n\nEn 1502.09 | Utility Accommodation Manual | The New Hampshire Department of Transportation (\"DOT\"), available from DOT",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1500.html"
